    "rendered": "Hacker Days"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-75f56b9d wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"min-height:0vh;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f15145cb wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-right:0;margin-left:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">Hacker Days</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Hacker Days</strong> is a hands-on, collaborative event organized by <strong><a href=\"https://ruralhackers.com/\">Rural Hackers</a></strong> that brings together technologists, designers, and rural enthusiasts to co-create innovative solutions for pressing challenges in rural communities. Over the course of <strong>one week</strong>, participants work in teams to develop functional prototypes—such as apps, tools, or systems—that address specific local needs, like water management, biodiversity monitoring, or digital inclusion. The event emphasizes <strong>community involvement</strong>, ensuring that solutions are practical, sustainable, and rooted in the realities of rural life. The next edition of Hacker Days will take place from <strong>September 1 to 7, 2025</strong>, at <strong><a href=\"https://anceu.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Anceu Coliving</a></strong> in Galicia, Spain, focusing on creating a digital solution to simplify water consumption tracking for the local water association. This event is open to anyone passionate about using technology and creativity to make a tangible impact in rural areas.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-accent-5-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4bb49aaa wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide\">Key points of Hacker Days</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_20240511_172631.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-308 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1296\" height=\"972\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_20240511_172631.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-308 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_20240511_172631.jpg 1296w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_20240511_172631-300x225.jpg 300w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_20240511_172631-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_20240511_172631-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1296px) 100vw, 1296px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);\">Focus on Real Problems</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Hacker Days tackles tangible issues faced by rural areas, such as <strong>community water management</strong>, <strong>biodiversity monitoring</strong>, or <strong>digital inclusion</strong>.<br><br></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_4457.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-311 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"729\" height=\"972\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_4457.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-311 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_4457.jpg 729w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_4457-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 729px) 100vw, 729px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);\">Collaborative Environment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Participants work in teams, combining their skills in&nbsp;<strong>technology, design, and community engagement</strong>&nbsp;to prototype solutions.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_2451.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-320 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"729\" height=\"972\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_2451.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-320 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_2451.jpg 729w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_2451-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 729px) 100vw, 729px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);\">Hands-On Prototyping</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Over the course of a week, participants develop&nbsp;<strong>functional prototypes</strong>&nbsp;that can be tested and implemented in the community.<br><br><br></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Entre-Culturas-Ed-II-7-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-567 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1499\" height=\"999\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Entre-Culturas-Ed-II-7-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-567 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Entre-Culturas-Ed-II-7-1.jpg 1499w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Entre-Culturas-Ed-II-7-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Entre-Culturas-Ed-II-7-1-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Entre-Culturas-Ed-II-7-1-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1499px) 100vw, 1499px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);\">Community-Centered</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Local residents, like&nbsp;<strong>Rogelio</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Rosabel</strong>, actively participate, ensuring solutions are practical and rooted in the community’s reality.<br><br><br></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_5679.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-492 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"729\" height=\"972\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_5679.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-492 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_5679.jpg 729w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IMG_5679-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 729px) 100vw, 729px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);\">Open source</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">All solutions are developed as&nbsp;<strong>open-source projects</strong>, allowing other rural communities to adapt and use them.<br><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-6108e6a5 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-1e881699 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"min-height:100%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-text-annotation has-x-small-font-size is-style-text-annotation--9\">Why matters</h2>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain has-x-large-font-size is-layout-flow wp-container-core-quote-is-layout-a54b8880 wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--10\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c61b7426 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Bridges the Urban-Rural Gap</p>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain has-x-large-font-size is-layout-flow wp-container-core-quote-is-layout-a54b8880 wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--11\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c61b7426 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Promotes Digital Inclusion</p>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain has-x-large-font-size is-layout-flow wp-container-core-quote-is-layout-a54b8880 wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--12\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c61b7426 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Empower local communities</p>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-41.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-382 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"627\" height=\"753\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-41.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-382 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-41.png 627w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-41-250x300.png 250w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 627px) 100vw, 627px\" /></noscript></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-accent-5-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><strong>Upcoming Hacker Days Event (2025)</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--13\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8220;September 1-7, 2025.&#8221;</p>\n<cite>When</cite></blockquote>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"/>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--14\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Anceu, Galicia. Spain</p>\n<cite>Where</cite></blockquote>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"/>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--15\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Develop a digital solution for <strong>community water management</strong> in Anceu village</p>\n<cite>Goal</cite></blockquote>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"/>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--16\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Developers, designers, UX experts, marketeers, communicators, and rural enthusiasts.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No prior experience in rural issues is required—just a willingness to collaborate and learn.</p>\n<cite>Who</cite></blockquote>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-17cd8e8e wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to get involved</h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"wpforms-container wpforms-container-full wpforms-block wpforms-block-6359a55b-85c2-4e03-b5af-6efb3dbb33e7 wpforms-render-modern\" id=\"wpforms-716\"><form id=\"wpforms-form-716\" class=\"wpforms-validate wpforms-form wpforms-ajax-form\" data-formid=\"716\" method=\"post\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" action=\"/wp-json/wp/v2/pages?per_page=100&#038;page=1\" data-token=\"c58ab326e8731b6d654f9c2ad79d97ff\" data-token-time=\"1785851439\"><noscript class=\"wpforms-error-noscript\">Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.</noscript><div id=\"wpforms-error-noscript\" style=\"display: none;\">Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.</div><div class=\"wpforms-field-container\"><div id=\"wpforms-716-field_1-container\" class=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-name\" data-field-id=\"1\"><fieldset><legend class=\"wpforms-field-label\">Name <span class=\"wpforms-required-label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></legend><div class=\"wpforms-field-row wpforms-field-large\"><div class=\"wpforms-field-row-block wpforms-first wpforms-one-half\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"wpforms-716-field_1\" class=\"wpforms-field-name-first wpforms-field-required\" name=\"wpforms[fields][1][first]\" aria-errormessage=\"wpforms-716-field_1-error\" required><label for=\"wpforms-716-field_1\" class=\"wpforms-field-sublabel after\">First</label></div><div class=\"wpforms-field-row-block wpforms-one-half\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"wpforms-716-field_1-last\" class=\"wpforms-field-name-last wpforms-field-required\" name=\"wpforms[fields][1][last]\" aria-errormessage=\"wpforms-716-field_1-last-error\" required><label for=\"wpforms-716-field_1-last\" class=\"wpforms-field-sublabel after\">Last</label></div></div></fieldset></div>\t\t<div id=\"wpforms-716-field_4-container\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-text\"\n\t\t\tdata-field-type=\"text\"\n\t\t\tdata-field-id=\"4\"\n\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t<label class=\"wpforms-field-label\" for=\"wpforms-716-field_4\" >to Hacker be</label>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"text\" id=\"wpforms-716-field_4\" class=\"wpforms-field-medium\" name=\"wpforms[fields][4]\" >\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div id=\"wpforms-716-field_2-container\" class=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-email\" data-field-id=\"2\"><label class=\"wpforms-field-label\" for=\"wpforms-716-field_2\">Email <span class=\"wpforms-required-label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input type=\"email\" id=\"wpforms-716-field_2\" class=\"wpforms-field-large wpforms-field-required\" name=\"wpforms[fields][2]\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-errormessage=\"wpforms-716-field_2-error\" required></div><div id=\"wpforms-716-field_3-container\" class=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-textarea\" data-field-id=\"3\"><label class=\"wpforms-field-label\" for=\"wpforms-716-field_3\">Why would you like to be part of Hacker Days 2025? <span class=\"wpforms-required-label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"wpforms-716-field_3\" class=\"wpforms-field-medium wpforms-field-required\" name=\"wpforms[fields][3]\" aria-errormessage=\"wpforms-716-field_3-error\" required></textarea></div><div id=\"wpforms-716-field_7-container\" class=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-textarea\" data-field-id=\"7\"><label class=\"wpforms-field-label\" for=\"wpforms-716-field_7\">How would you like to contribute? <span class=\"wpforms-required-label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"wpforms-716-field_7\" class=\"wpforms-field-medium wpforms-field-required\" name=\"wpforms[fields][7]\" aria-errormessage=\"wpforms-716-field_7-error\" required></textarea></div><script>\n\t\t\t\t( function() {\n\t\t\t\t\tconst style = document.createElement( 'style' );\n\t\t\t\t\tstyle.appendChild( document.createTextNode( '#wpforms-716-field_4-container { position: absolute !important; overflow: hidden !important; display: inline !important; height: 1px !important; width: 1px !important; z-index: -1000 !important; padding: 0 !important; } #wpforms-716-field_4-container input { visibility: hidden; } #wpforms-conversational-form-page #wpforms-716-field_4-container label { counter-increment: none; }' ) );\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.head.appendChild( style );\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.currentScript?.remove();\n\t\t\t\t} )();\n\t\t\t</script></div><!-- .wpforms-field-container --><div class=\"wpforms-submit-container\" ><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"wpforms[id]\" value=\"716\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page_title\" value=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page_url\" value=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-json/wp/v2/pages?per_page=100&#038;page=1\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url_referer\" value=\"\"><button type=\"submit\" name=\"wpforms[submit]\" id=\"wpforms-submit-716\" class=\"wpforms-submit\" data-alt-text=\"Sending...\" data-submit-text=\"Submit\" aria-live=\"assertive\" value=\"wpforms-submit\">Submit</button><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/plugins/wpforms-lite/assets/images/submit-spin.svg\" class=\"wpforms-submit-spinner lazyload\" style=\"display: none;\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" alt=\"Loading\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/plugins/wpforms-lite/assets/images/submit-spin.svg\" class=\"wpforms-submit-spinner lazyload\" style=\"display: none;\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" alt=\"Loading\"></noscript></div></form></div>  <!-- .wpforms-container --></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Join as a Participant</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Apply to be part of the next Hacker Days event in the form.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No matter your background, your skills can make a difference.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Support as a Partner</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Companies like <strong>SiteGround</strong>, <strong>Eleven Yellow</strong> and <strong>WordPress.com</strong> have already supported Hacker Days.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If your organization wants to contribute, reach out in <a href=\"mailto:hello@ruralhackers.com\">hello@ruralhackers.com</a></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Adapt the Model</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Hacker Days is open-source. If you’re part of another rural community, you can replicate this model to solve local challenges.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<aside class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-3 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0553457c wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-section-3--17\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-65db5ff9 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"min-height:360px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\">Follow us in real life</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center is-style-text-subtitle is-style-text-subtitle--18 wp-block-paragraph\">Have you imagine the possibility of getting to know each other? That will be fantastic.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer wp-container-content-62aae154\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-offbit-trial-font-family\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\" href=\"https://ruralhackers.com/contact/\">Contact</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n",
